============================================================
  WIRING DIAGRAM - ESP32 BOMB PROJECT
============================================================

RC522 (card reader, SPI)
------------------------------------------------------------
  VCC   ----------------->  ESP32 3V3
  GND   ----------------->  ESP32 GND
  RST   ----------------->  GPIO27
  MISO  ----------------->  GPIO19   (fixed, hardware SPI)
  MOSI  ----------------->  GPIO23   (fixed, hardware SPI)
  SCK   ----------------->  GPIO18   (fixed, SPI clock)
  NSS   ----------------->  GPIO5    (also called SDA/SS)
  IRQ   ----------------->  do not connect

OLED SH1106 (display, I2C)
------------------------------------------------------------
  GND   ----------------->  ESP32 GND
  VCC   ----------------->  ESP32 3V3
  SDA   ----------------->  GPIO21   (I2C data)
  SCL   ----------------->  GPIO22   (I2C clock)

LED (red, with ~220-330 ohm resistor)
------------------------------------------------------------
  Anode (+)   ----------->  GPIO17   (through resistor)
  Cathode (-) ----------->  ESP32 GND

Buzzer (sound)
------------------------------------------------------------
  +  --------------------->  GPIO16
  -  --------------------->  ESP32 GND

============================================================
  Note: connect all VCCs to the same 3V3 and all GNDs to
  the same GND (or a shared GND rail on the breadboard).
============================================================
